"><title>Jan 5, 2026, 00f4244: 2 s</title></circle><circle class="pt-point pt-last" cx="624" cy="110.6" r="4.5"><title>Jan 6, 2026, 00f4245: 2.05 s</title></circle></g></svg><figcaption>LCP went from 1.8 s to 2.05 s over 6 deploys, best 1.8 s. 1 of 6 outside the 2.5 s budget.</figcaption></figure>"`;

